    "detailed_description": "Outmaneuver endless waves of enemies for high score!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480740/extras/b1f480ea80c5a3cd8223e041214c49c2.poster.avif?t=1749117385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480740/extras/b1f480ea80c5a3cd8223e041214c49c2.webm?t=1749117385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480740/extras/b1f480ea80c5a3cd8223e041214c49c2.mp4?t=1749117385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this platforming survival arena you collect points and survive long as you can. Play as a cute Mushy who adventures nearby forest and fights for their life. Can you survive long enough to get new high score?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced gameplay with different types of enemies.<br></li><li>Cute and colorful pixel art game with beautiful backgrounds.<br></li><li>Use elemental powers to improve your character<br></li><li>Easy to start but the challenge ramps up quickly.</li></ul>",
